# Cloudflare static asset headers for the hub's own pages. Each project sets its own
# headers in its own repo (an experiment that shouldn't be indexed sends X-Robots-Tag: noindex).

# Security headers on every response:
# - Strict-Transport-Security: browsers only ever use HTTPS for this site.
# - X-Content-Type-Options: browsers don't guess a file's type.
# - Referrer-Policy: other sites learn only the domain a visitor came from, not the page.
# - X-Frame-Options: other sites can't embed these pages in a frame.
# - Permissions-Policy: no page here can use the camera, microphone or location.
/*
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  X-Frame-Options: SAMEORIGIN
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=()
